   489	    /// `CopperGolem.actuallyHurt` (CopperGolem.java:450-453): once damage is applied, the
   490	    /// synched animation state snaps back to IDLE, cancelling any in-progress chest
   491	    /// interaction animation. `Mob::on_damage` only runs after the damage landed, which is
   492	    /// exactly vanilla's `actuallyHurt` position in the hurt pipeline.
   493	    fn on_damage<'a>(
   494	        &'a self,
   495	        _damage_type: DamageType,
   496	        _source: Option<&'a dyn EntityBase>,
